{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1310809001:0":{"text":"Magister! Listen... This undead warrior is talking!","source_cn":"咦？主人，你听，这个活死人……在说话！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38C6E17AFB8235B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister! Listen... This undead warrior is talking!","female":"Magister! Listen... This undead warrior is talking!","variant_male_record_index":"143670","variant_female_record_index":"143671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310809002:1":{"text":"Fight... follow... until death...","source_cn":"战斗……追随……啊……至死……方休……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94635E1C84F5F7FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310809003:0":{"text":"He seems to retain some of his consciousness... Umm... Hello, Mister Undead, sir... Did you say \"follow\"? Who are you following? Who are you fighting against?","source_cn":"他似乎还有些残存的理智。这位……活死人先生，你说“追随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C428E92077B8F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310809004:1":{"text":"Uhhh... Hypo... geans... every... where...","source_cn":"啊……啊啊……恶、恶魔……到处……都是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DD452F5B77BA4CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310809005:0":{"text":"General... oath... of honor... Fight... until death!","source_cn":"……将、将军……以荣誉……发誓……战斗……战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3776DA569DCC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310809006:0":{"text":"Ugh...!","source_cn":"啊……啊啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AC6FEBDC3312454","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310809007:0":{"text":"Oh no, he's becoming agitated...!","source_cn":"他的情绪越来越激动了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8980CFD8585FD5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310809007":{"text":"Oh no, he's becoming agitated...!","source_cn":"他的情绪越来越激动了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8980CFD8585FD5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310809008:0":{"text":"Okay... It's a little cruel, but Chippy knows it's better to let him rest in peace.","source_cn":"好吧……满满知道这很残酷，可是他现在这个样子……也许让...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF23F5DD75D3C55E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Okay... It's a little cruel, but Chippy knows it's better to let him rest in peace.","female":"Okay... It's a little cruel, but Chippy knows it's better to let him rest in peace.","variant_male_record_index":"143678","variant_female_record_index":"143679","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310809009:0":{"text":"At least he won't be in pain anymore...","source_cn":"至少，这样他不会再这么痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B54C3F645EC8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310809010:0":{"text":"I'm sorry, Mister Undead. I hope you'll be reborn to a peaceful, happy life.","source_cn":"活死人先生，对不起……希望你能重新回归生命的循环，不再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E02F2B7C011BB57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310809011:0":{"text":"Uh... ah...","source_cn":"啊……啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335B8A2B79C5122A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"He must be eliminated.","source_cn":"必须消灭他","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD802BE77EC1223A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He must be eliminated.","female":"He must be eliminated.","variant_male_record_index":"68310","variant_female_record_index":"68311","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310809012:0":{"text":"Calm him down? How?! We can hardly talk to him like this.","source_cn":"诶？安抚？！可是该怎么安抚啊！他这个样子，我们很难和他...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD76FF3381DADD7F5","variant_sta